id: pm-gh1456
title: "GH-1456: Discoverable SDK-backed bulk creation with JSONL and keyed upsert"
description: "Extend the shipped atomic SDK/CLI mutation primitive with a discoverable bulk-create workflow, JSONL input and optional keyed upsert. The existing pm item mutate surface already commits ordered create/update/close batches and must be reused rather than reimplemented."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[5]: agent-ux,"area:cli","area:sdk",bulk-mutations,github-intake
created_at: "2026-10-13T18:12:30.417Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-17T02:29:03.210Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-16T22:27:55.332Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-16T22:27:55.332Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: Document and execute the existing atomic create batch as the immediate recovery; Any create-many adapter delegates to public SDK transaction primitives; JSONL/ref resolution and keyed upsert preserve input order and validate before persistence; Interrupted or repeated imports preserve complete history and stable idempotency
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "SDK-first JSONL/document bulk creation, stable references, guarded upserts and replay are shared by CLI and MCP. Latest-close compensation ownership preserves later explicit or routed user closure. The generated refusal census includes the additive conflict code."
expected_result: "Compensation retries preserve user lifecycle decisions, and generated SDK/agent contracts agree with implemented refusals under unchanged quality bounds."
actual_result: "108 linked SDK/CLI/MCP cases pass with unchanged c1dfe27 production code. Three public SDK controls pass on c1dfe27; the earlier81e baseline fails the later-explicit-close regression. Typecheck/lint and generated agent-surface, catalogue and full-contract checks pass; first-party artifact is19,119,278 bytes across1684files. Final hosted checks and renewed incremental review remain required."
