  - created_at: "2026-10-16T11:37:22.702Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final full-review documentation follow-up: verified deriveMutationTransactionId hashes the exact input bytes and parseJournal accepts changed plans only after full compensation. Agent, command and SDK guides now distinguish original transaction identity, unchanged committed/resumable plans, formatting-only edits and fully compensated retries. Runtime code and tests are unchanged. pnpm build and pnpm quality:docs-links pass; reviewed parent 94345b4 passed all 26 required checks, 100/100/100/100 coverage and bounded mutation controls (341 killed, 7 equivalent, zero timeouts). New documentation/metadata head still requires hosted checks and full review."
  - created_at: "2026-10-16T12:29:31.959Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Runtime review verification: 10537 tests passed in the full source run; the sole failing check enforced the unchanged 120-file SDK directory cap after adding a helper. Moved the shared duration validator into the lifecycle folder, preserving the cap. The final patch also refuses object-valued journal statuses without coercion and gives stored metadata keys precedence over aliases from other fields. The final full source coverage run remains required; no coverage or layout threshold was relaxed."
